/* The notice of an item on the ground or in a chest is the story's speech box (tamer.c: tamerTickPickupItem opens
   renderItemPickupTextbox's box at -130, 42, 262 x 59 from the screen's centre: x 30 to 292 and y 162 to 221, the
   speech box's place; ../story_textbox/structure.rcss), with the item's name on its first row and the words on the
   second (renderString at y 0x2D and 0x39). The name is TEXT_COLORS 15 (0x48, 0x54, 0x7C) over the font's ink
   #d0d0d0 (utils.c). */

/* The story's box lets the clicks fall through to the field (../story_textbox/structure.rcss); this notice takes
   them itself, as its own `confirm`: the mouse answers it by clicking the box (document.rml). */
#box {
	pointer-events: auto;
}

#item {
	color: #7588c9;
}
